flowchart TD
  start([Nightly purge job, 03:00 UTC]) --> migrate[Apply pending migrations]
  migrate --> diagrams[Diagrams deleted over 30 days ago]
  diagrams --> drafts[AI drafts never saved, over 24 hours old]
  drafts --> remove[Delete them with versions, chat, comments, shares, notifications]
  remove --> projects[Projects deleted over 30 days ago]
  projects --> empty{Still holds diagrams or sub-projects?}
  empty -- Yes --> skip[Skip it and report why]
  empty -- No --> delproj[Delete it with its shares and notifications]
  skip --> notes[Notifications older than 90 days]
  delproj --> notes
  notes --> finish([Report what was removed])
